    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "No Dispatch Record",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "night_city",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "11:08 PM · Pine Pass Highway. Your sedan skids into a guardrail in thick fog. Before you can even dial 911, flashing red lights pull up behind you.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "[Emergency Text] Hi 911, I’m okay—your ambulance just reached Mile Marker 18 super fast!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:09 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "disp",
          "text": "MA’AM/SIR, LOCK YOUR DOORS NOW! County Dispatch has ZERO ambulances on Pine Pass tonight! Nearest unit is 14 miles away!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:09 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "disp",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[urgent typing] Stay inside your vehicle, {{player_name}}! Do NOT roll down your window—look at the ambulance’s side number and text it to me!",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 800,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "emt",
          "text": "Unlock the door, {{player_name}}. You’re bleeding from the forehead—let me help.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "EMT-00 unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "A gloved hand taps softly on your fogged driver window:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_095_e1_free",
              "label": "Keep doors locked & crank the engine",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "No unit number on the van—it’s painted over! Trying to restart my car!",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_095_e1_vip",
              "label": "Flash your high beams & record his face",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "The starter whines weakly—then dies. The radiator hisses steam. Outside, the \"paramedic\" reaches into his medical bag and pulls out a heavy window-punch.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "disp",
          "text": "Troopers are speeding up Pine Pass—hold on! Lay on your car horn continuously to scare him off!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:11 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You snap a clear shot through the windshield as he flinches from the glare—and recognize the jagged scar on his cheek. He’s the tow-truck driver from the gas station 20 miles back.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "photo_snap",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "He cut my brake line at the gas station!! That’s why my car skidded at Mile 18!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:11 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09_merge",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "emt",
          "text": "Stop honking, {{player_name}}. Nobody hears you in this fog.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:12 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "CRACK! The driver’s window spiders into a white web. He swings the tool back for a second strike.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "One Swing Left",
          "teaser_text": "The glass won’t hold another hit—and the real troopers are still six minutes down the mountain.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 2,
      "title": "Into The Fog",
      "start_node_id": "e2_n01",
      "default_ambient": "horror_whisper",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e2_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "11:13 PM · You dive over the center console, shove the passenger door open, and tumble into the misty pine ravine.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n02",
          "type": "incoming_call",
          "caller_id": "disp",
          "caller_label": "911 · Unit 4",
          "ringtone_sfx": "call_ring",
          "ring_duration_ms": 12000,
          "can_decline": true,
          "on_answer_node_id": "e2_n03_ans",
          "on_decline_node_id": "e2_n03_dec"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03_ans",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "disp",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[radio chatter] Stay low in the trees, {{player_name}}! Do NOT use your flashlight—Trooper 7 just passed Mile 15!",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03_dec",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "disp",
          "text": "Keep your screen brightness at zero! Trooper 7 is 3 miles below you—head DOWNHILL toward the sirens!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:13 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 500,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "emt",
          "text": "Come back to the road, {{player_name}}. You dropped your wallet on the passenger seat—I know where you live.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:14 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n05",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Wait... his ambulance is still idling on the road with the keys inside!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:14 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "His flashlight beam sweeps ten yards above you:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_095_e2_free",
              "label": "Sprint downhill toward the police sirens",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "I hear the sirens! Running down the drainage ditch now!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_095_e2_vip",
              "label": "Circle back & hijack his fake ambulance",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You burst onto the asphalt at Mile 17 straight into the blinding lightbar of Trooper 7. Up the hill, the fake ambulance’s tires screech as it flees into the fog.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "disp",
          "text": "Trooper 7 confirms you’re safe! Roadblocks are going up at both ends of Pine Pass!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:17 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "While he searches the treeline, you vault into the ambulance cab, lock the doors, and floor it straight into the waiting police blockade—with all his evidence inside the back.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "disp",
          "text": "WAIT—you stole the suspect’s own ambulance?! Troopers just found a stack of missing-person IDs in the glovebox!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:17 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n09_merge",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "emt",
          "text": "I still have your driver’s license, {{player_name}}. See you when you get home.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "EMT-00 unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n10",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Wrapped in a shock blanket inside the cruiser, you watch the troopers’ radio crackle: \"Suspect fled on foot into Pine Gorge—armed and unaccounted for.\"",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "He Has Your Address",
          "teaser_text": "You survived Mile Marker 18—but the fake paramedic vanished into the fog with your wallet and house key.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 3
        }
      ]
    },
